'''Guzzlord ex''' (Japanese: '''アクジキングex''' ''Akuziking ex'') is a {{ct|Darkness}} Basic {{TCGP|Pokémon ex}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Extradimensional Crisis}} expansion.

