==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's shiny super rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Guzzlord}}.
*The '''Grindcore''' attack is named after {{wp|grindcore}}, a genre of music. The name may have been chosen in reference to {{p|Guzzlord}}'s lore, as a creature capable of grinding down and eating anything.
*'''Tyrannical Hole''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Crimson Invasion|Guzzlord-GX|63}} from the {{TCG|Crimson Invasion}} expansion.

